<title>CHINA: Shanghai Wing Sung changes manager.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Wing Sung changes manager.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stationery maker Wing Sung's general manager Hu Jianping has left for a new position, and the post is being left vacant for now, a company statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The statement said vice-general manager Yao Qing would take on the responsibilities of the job.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for Hu changing jobs.</p>
</text>
